<title>FRANCE: UK fund acquires 15 percent of Jean-Claude Darmon.</title>
<headline>UK fund acquires 15 percent of Jean-Claude Darmon.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French sports advertiser Jean-Claude Darmon said on Monday that British pension fund Henderson Investors had acquired 15 percent of its capital at 295 francs per share.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the off-market transaction took place on March 6.</p>
<p>Jean-Claude Darmon was launched on the Paris bourse's secondary market at 215 francs per share on December 5.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
